.next

# Build output — regenerated by `npm run build`
# (build now runs sass-min first, so public/css/ is produced too).
# These were committed and drifted from src/: the stale bundle kept pointing at
# the old dev API host long after config.js was fixed.
public/bundles/
public/css/

# IDE + tooling artifacts
.idea/
SUMMARY_claudeqt.json

# Third-party shader demos are vendored unpacked (with their LICENSE.txt);
# the redundant archives are deliberately not tracked.
src/effects/*.zip
